  "name": "Russian Squat Program",
  "level": "Advanced",
  "durationWeeks": 6,
  "daysPerWeek": 3,
  "description": "A demanding 6-week, squat-only program built around rising volume and intensity on the Back Squat, followed by a short taper into a genuine new 1RM. Percentages are calculated directly off the current 1RM (not a reduced Training Max, unlike 5/3/1). Not recommended for beginners — requires a technically solid, comfortable Back Squat before starting.",
  "requiresInput": {
    "oneRepMaxInputs": ["back-squat"],
    "unit": "kg or lb, person's choice"
  },
  "safetyNote": "This program is high-frequency and high-volume by design. The lighter days matter as much as the heavy ones — skipping them undermines the whole approach. If a session feels genuinely off (poor sleep, illness, joint pain), repeat a lighter day rather than pushing through.",
